		{"id":"7bd54d4d4499189f","x":-440,"y":-180,"width":665,"height":170,"type":"text","text":"This is where all the farmers live and where all food for the city is made it is magically enchanted by the nobles. This is where Basil  and his family live. They are farmers who make local wine and are fairly well off but because they were born low it is incredibly hard for them even with their money to gain a noble house. The parents' names are Villia and Zitslar; they are elves and love Stu."}
